# Scacelith - Čeština
# Translation of assets/i18n/en.lang (same keys, same {n}). Plurals: one (1)|few (2-4)|other (0, 5+).
# Register: formal "vy" (lower case), help texts in the formal imperative, buttons and menu
# commands in the infinitive ("Uložit", "Vzdát se"), sentence case; titles in capitals as in English.
# The player's gender is unknown: no past tense or participle agreeing with "vy" ("vyhrál jste",
# "jste přihlášen"); nouns, the present tense or impersonal phrasing instead ("Výhra", "Odhlášení").
# Quality levels are feminine (they agree with "kvalita"); engine.thousand/million use "tis."/"mil."
# (no agreement); gif.wait.* are accusative (they only follow "za"). Terms as in the cs glossary.
# Keep the sections: other parts of the game add their keys in sections of their own.

